bplist00�XUTI-Data�[public.htmlO��<head><meta charset="UTF-8"></head><div _ngcontent-ng-c1020695632="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_9dd6ef0dd2d85b3f" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">This document is designed to be fed directly into an AI coding assistant (like Cursor or Claude) as a primary<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="110" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">SYSTEM_PROMPT</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>or<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="127" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">project_plan.md</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>file. It uses C++ and Raylib via CMake, ensuring seamless compilation on both macOS (ARM64) and Windows (x64) without heavy IDE dependencies.</div><br><h2 data-path-to-node="1" style="font-family: Google Sans, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">0. Architecture &amp; Stack Definitions</h2><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Tech Stack:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>C++17, Raylib 5.0 (for rendering/input), CMake (build system).</div><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="75" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Memory Model:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Flat data arrays and Object Pooling. No complex Entity-Component-System (ECS).</div><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="168" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Rendering:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>2D Isometric Projection. All internal logic (physics, collisions, generation) runs on a 2D Cartesian grid. The isometric transformation is strictly a rendering step.</div><br><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Folder Structure to Enforce:</b></div><br><ul data-path-to-node="4" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">/src</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>- All<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="11" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">.cpp</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>and<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="20" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">.hpp</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>files.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">/assets</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>- Textures and sounds.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">/build</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>- CMake output (gitignored).</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">CMakeLists.txt</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>- Must fetch Raylib dynamically via<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="51" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">FetchContent</code>.</div><br></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="6" style="font-family: Google Sans, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Phase 1: Engine Foundation &amp; Isometric Math</h2><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Goal:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Establish the game loop, cross-platform compilation, and the foundational Cartesian-to-Isometric coordinate math.</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="8" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 1.1: CMake Setup.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Write a<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="31" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">CMakeLists.txt</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>that pulls Raylib 5.0 from GitHub using<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="86" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">FetchContent</code>and links it to a<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="117" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">main.cpp</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>executable. Ensure Apple Silicon (<code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="160" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">-arch arm64</code>) and Windows compilation flags are handled.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 1.2: State Machine.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement a basic game loop in<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="56" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">main.cpp</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>with a finite state machine:<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="94" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">INIT</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="100" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">MAIN_MENU</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="111" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">PLAYING</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="120" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">GAME_OVER</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="131" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">VICTORY</code>.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 1.3: Isometric Helper Class.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Create a math utility class with two static functions:</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="8,2,1" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="8,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Vector2 CartesianToIsometric(Vector2 cartesian)</code>: Formula is<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="60" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">isoX = cartX - cartY</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="8,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="82" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">isoY = (cartX + cartY) / 2</code>.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="8,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Vector2 IsometricToCartesian(Vector2 isometric)</code>: For converting mouse clicks back to grid space.</div><br></li></ul></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="8,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 1.4: Y-Sorting Renderer.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement a rendering queue. In isometric games, entities must be drawn from top to bottom (lowest Y-value to highest Y-value) to overlap correctly.</div><br></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="9" style="font-family: Google Sans, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Phase 2: Procedural Generation &amp; The 10-Level Manager</h2><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Goal:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Generate playable Cartesian grids and manage the 10-stage progression loop.</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="11" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 2.1: Level Manager.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Create a<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="34" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">LevelManager</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>class tracking<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="62" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">currentLevel</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>(1 to 10).</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 2.2: BSP Grid Generator.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement a Room-and-Corridor generator on a 2D<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="78" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">int</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>array (0 = void, 1 = floor, 2 = wall).</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="11,1,1" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><i data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Constraint for Agent:</i><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Level 1 starts at a 30x30 grid with 3 rooms. Map size and room count scale linearly up to Level 10 (e.g., 100x100 grid, 15 rooms).</div><br></li></ul></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 2.3: Grid Rendering.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Iterate through the Cartesian grid array, convert the<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="80" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">(x, y)</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>indices to Isometric coordinates, and draw a simple diamond polygon (or isometric tile sprite) for floors, and a raised cube for walls.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 2.4: Spawn Points.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Algorithmically identify the room furthest left for the<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="80" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">PlayerSpawn</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>and the room furthest right for the<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="128" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">LevelExit</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>tile.</div><br></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="12" style="font-family: Google Sans, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Phase 3: Player Controller &amp; Combat Systems</h2><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Goal:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement flat-array entity management, shooting, and collision.</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="14" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 3.1: Player Entity.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement WASD movement. The player moves in Cartesian space, but visual movement is rendered isometrically.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 3.2: Grid Collision.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement AABB collision against the Cartesian grid. Prevent movement if the player's target X/Y overlaps a cell marked as<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="149" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">2</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>(wall).</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 3.3: Mouse Aiming.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Use<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="28" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">IsometricToCartesian</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>to find where the mouse is pointing on the grid. Calculate the angle between the player and the mouse for aiming.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 3.4: Bullet Pool.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Pre-allocate an array of 500<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="52" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Bullet</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>structs (<code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="68" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">active</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="76" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">x</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="79" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">y</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="82" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">velocity_x</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="94" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">velocity_y</code>).</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="14,4,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 3.5: Firing Logic.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>On left-click, find the first inactive bullet, set it to active, assign its position to the player, and set its velocity toward the mouse Cartesian coordinate.</div><br></li></ul><h2 data-path-to-node="15" style="font-family: Google Sans, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Phase 4: Enemy AI &amp; Scaling Difficulty</h2><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Goal:</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Populate the levels with enemies that scale in difficulty from Level 1 to 10.</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="17" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 4.1: Enemy Pool.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Pre-allocate an array of 200<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="51" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Enemy</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>structs (<code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="66" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">active</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="74" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">type</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="80" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">health</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="88" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">x</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="91" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">y</code>,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="94" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">state</code>).</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 4.2: AI State Machine.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement a simple AI per enemy:</div><br><ul data-path-to-node="17,1,1" style="padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="17,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">IDLE</code>: Stand still.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><code data-path-to-node="17,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">CHASE</code>: If line-of-sight to player is clear (no walls in grid array between them), move toward player.</div><br></li></ul></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="17,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 4.3: Combat Resolution.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>In the main loop, check distance between active bullets and active enemies. If distance &lt; radius, deactivate bullet, subtract enemy health. If health &lt;= 0, deactivate enemy.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="17,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 4.4: The Difficulty Matrix.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement the following scaling logic based on the<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="17,3,0" data-index-in-node="84" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">LevelManager::currentLevel</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>(1-10):</div><br></li></ul><table data-path-to-node="18" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><thead style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><tr style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><strong style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;">Level</strong></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !import