ss="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="57" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">LevelExit</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>tile, clear all active bullets and enemies, increment<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="121" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">currentLevel</code>, and regenerate the map. If<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="162" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">currentLevel &gt; 10</code>, trigger<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="21,0,0" data-index-in-node="189" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">VICTORY</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>state.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="21,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 5.2: Camera Lerping.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>Implement a 2D camera that smoothly interpolates (lerps) toward the player's isometric pixel position, rather than snapping instantly.</div><br></li><li style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><div style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="21,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Task 5.3: Particle Pool.</b><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>(Optional but recommended) Create a flat array of<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code data-path-to-node="21,2,0" data-index-in-node="75" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;">Particle</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>structs for simple square hit-sparks when bullets hit walls or enemies.</div></li></ul><div class="attachment-container unknown" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;"><follow-up _nghost-ng-c1254911661="" class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" style="font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !